Presence of this file opts every Java source set, tests and testSupport included,
into protoblast's checkPrivateRetryDelays compile gate. Waits after failed attempts
come from Backoff: fixed/exponential, jittered/jitteredBelow/plusUpTo, a server wait
as delayAfter's floor up to the ceiling honouringUpTo declares, Attempts for
delay-only counters and nextAt for stored due times. The shared Java lexer ignores
comments/literals and checks whole-file code, including split calls. The mechanism
and its own proof are exempt by path; there is no per-line excuse. Renamed-local
curves, lookup tables and non-Java bodies remain outside this guard's coverage.
